<section class="case-section" aria-labelledby="relict-shipping">
    <h2 id="relict-shipping">Iteration, Debugging &amp; Shipping</h2>
    <p>I supported AI and performance fixes, navmesh troubleshooting, controller/input issues, UI regressions, and ability bugs as content changed. Checks revisited navigation after level changes, controls after UI updates, and combat as enemy and ability content evolved.</p>
    <p>This ongoing maintenance carried the systems beyond their initial implementation and into the final capstone build.</p>
